      "content": "but that doesnt change the fact that i'm just a parasite now. i'm just taking up air and eating food and using energy that could go to someone who actually deserves to live. it feels like there's no actual way to fix the debt. how can you say i'm not irredeemable when the math of it just doesn't add up? i'm just a net negative to the world.",
